---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Refund Policy — Nexus Wave Technologies">
  <section class="hero legal-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Billing</p><h1>Refund Policy</h1><p class="lead">General information for subscription and digital-service refund requests.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container legal-shell"><nav class="legal-nav" aria-label="Legal pages"><a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/legal/terms">Terms</a><a href="/legal/refund">Refunds</a><a href="/legal/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a><a href="/legal/accessibility">Accessibility</a></nav><article class="prose card legal-document">
    <h2>Paid features covered by this policy</h2><p>Nexus Plus keeps Women Safety, core community services, basic utilities and other designated free services available without a paid subscription. This policy primarily applies to paid AI features, premium AI tools, AI credits and any other capability explicitly labelled as paid before purchase.</p>
<h2>Digital services</h2><p>Because digital subscriptions and usage credits can provide immediate access, refunds are reviewed based on the transaction, service status, applicable law, and the terms presented at purchase. Nothing in this policy removes mandatory consumer rights.</p>
    <h2>Failed or duplicate charges</h2><p>Contact us promptly with the transaction details when a charge failed, was duplicated, or a paid feature was not delivered as expected.</p>
    <h2>Payment provider</h2><p>A payment gateway such as PayU may process the transaction. Payment-provider terms, bank rules and applicable consumer-protection requirements may also apply.</p>
    <h2>How to request help</h2><p>Send your request to <a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a> with the account email, transaction date, and a brief description of the issue. Do not email passwords or payment card numbers.</p>
    <p class="muted">Payment-provider rules or local consumer-protection rights may provide additional remedies.</p>
  </article></div></section>
<style is:global>
  .legal-hero{padding:72px 0 40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--color-surface),var(--color-bg))}
  .legal-hero .lead{max-width:760px}
  .legal-shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px;align-items:start}
  .legal-nav{position:sticky;top:96px;display:grid;gap:6px;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--color-surface)}
  .legal-nav a{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--color-text-muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:650}
  .legal-nav a:hover,.legal-nav a[aria-current=page]{background:var(--color-surface-soft);color:var(--color-text)}
  .legal-document{padding:32px}
  .legal-document h2{margin:34px 0 10px;font-size:1.35rem}
  .legal-document h2:first-child{margin-top:0}
  .legal-document p{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.75}
  .legal-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:20px}
  .legal-meta span{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:999px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  @media(max-width:850px){.legal-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.legal-nav{position:static;display:flex;overflow:auto}.legal-nav a{flex:0 0 auto}.legal-document{padding:24px}}
</style>
</Layout>